{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"RHLW-2026-19f4511248f79d69","published":"2026-11-09T00:50:22Z","modified":"2026-11-10T08:43:12.631396777Z","upstream":["CVE-2024-23944","CVE-2026-24308","CVE-2026-59739","CVE-2026-59969","CVE-2026-79993","CVE-2026-84439","CVE-2026-84501","GHSA-crhr-qqj8-rpxc","GHSA-r978-9m6m-6gm6"],"summary":"Lightwell Security Advisory: zookeeper 3.8.3.rhlw-00015","details":"Red Hat Lightwell has released org.apache.zookeeper:zookeeper 3.8.3.rhlw-00015 with backported fixes for CVE-2024-23944, CVE-2026-24308, CVE-2026-59739, CVE-2026-59969, CVE-2026-79993, CVE-2026-84439, and CVE-2026-84501.\n\nCVE-2024-23944: Apache ZooKeeper: Information disclosure in persistent watcher handling\n\nCVE-2026-24308: Apache ZooKeeper: Sensitive information disclosure in client configuration handling\n\nCVE-2026-59739: Apache ZooKeeper: Information disclosure via SetWatches reconnect replay\n\nCVE-2026-59969: Apache ZooKeeper: Improper validation of certificate with host mismatch in FIPS mode\n\nCVE-2026-79993: Apache ZooKeeper: Missing ACL check on deleteContainer opcode allows unauthorized deletion of any empty persistent/container znode\n\nCVE-2026-84439: Apache ZooKeeper: Audit log injection via unsanitized output from multiple sources\n\nCVE-2026-84501: Apache ZooKeeper: Operational log forgery via newline injection in EnsembleAuthenticationProvider\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.apache.zookeeper:zookeeper 3.8.3 from Maven Central.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"org.apache.zookeeper:zookeeper","ecosystem":"Red Hat Lightwell:Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/org.apache.zookeeper/zookeeper"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.8.3.rhlw-00015"}]}],"versions":["3.3.0","3.3.1","3.3.2","3.3.3","3.3.4","3.3.5","3.3.6","3.4.0","3.4.1","3.4.10","3.4.11","3.4.12","3.4.13","3.4.14","3.4.2","3.4.3","3.4.4","3.4.5","3.4.6","3.4.7","3.4.8","3.4.9","3.5.0-alpha","3.5.1-alpha","3.5.10","3.5.2-alpha","3.5.3-beta","3.5.4-beta",